    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Starlight Blade</strong><br><i>Master Precision. Shatter Defenses. Claim Victory.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KINDLE THE LIGHT, DISPEL THE DARKNESS:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Where the Sun once knew no setting, the Moon has risen. A Veil of Darkness shrouded the light, and its Cult opened the hunt for the Star-forged. Stand ready to challenge the Lunars, the stars that have gone dark. Fight your way through the Army of the Moon. Blade and resolve \u2013 these are the weapons that will carve your path to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770960/extras/e5f198908eed6f81d5bea02958979687.poster.avif?t=1754407198\" width=800 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770960/extras/e5f198908eed6f81d5bea02958979687.webm?t=1754407198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770960/extras/e5f198908eed6f81d5bea02958979687.mp4?t=1754407198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INTENSE &amp; TACTICAL COMBAT:</strong> <br>Fast-paced, third-person sword fights where spotting and destroying glowing weak points are key to victory. Break enemy armor, cut off limbs, expose their core. Every weak point destroyed changes the fight \u2013 enemies become more dangerous, but also more vulnerable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770960/extras/2327e329815c83f653f11e8a86344ac7.poster.avif?t=1754407198\" width=800 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770960/extras/2327e329815c83f653f11e8a86344ac7.webm?t=1754407198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770960/extras/2327e329815c83f653f11e8a86344ac7.mp4?t=1754407198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOUR ESSENTIAL MOVES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Lunge:</strong> Your game-changing move. Quickly dash to an exposed weak point or grab a grapple point for a deadly strike or quick dodge. Fail, and you're open to attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parry &amp; Stagger:</strong> Use your timing to block enemy attacks and fill their stagger meter. When it's full, they'll be stunned, and their weak points will glow \u2013 your chance to deliver a powerful attack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heavy Smashes:</strong> Break through armor, knock down enemies, and destroy the environment to create obstacles or new routes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart Positioning:</strong>\u00a0Find the right angles for devastating attacks, take advantage of high ground, and use enemy strength against them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STAY AGGRESSIVE, STAY ALIVE:</strong><br>Destroy weak points to recover health and stay in the fight for longer. Experience intense, strategic combat, mixed with exploration and physics-based puzzles, all while using your core combat moves.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Starlight Blade</strong><br><i>Master Precision. Shatter Defenses. Claim Victory.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KINDLE THE LIGHT, DISPEL THE DARKNESS:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Where the Sun once knew no setting, the Moon has risen. A Veil of Darkness shrouded the light, and its Cult opened the hunt for the Star-forged. Stand ready to challenge the Lunars, the stars that have gone dark. Fight your way through the Army of the Moon. Blade and resolve \u2013 these are the weapons that will carve your path to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770960/extras/e5f198908eed6f81d5bea02958979687.poster.avif?t=1754407198\" width=800 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770960/extras/e5f198908eed6f81d5bea02958979687.webm?t=1754407198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770960/extras/e5f198908eed6f81d5bea02958979687.mp4?t=1754407198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INTENSE &amp; TACTICAL COMBAT:</strong> <br>Fast-paced, third-person sword fights where spotting and destroying glowing weak points are key to victory. Break enemy armor, cut off limbs, expose their core. Every weak point destroyed changes the fight \u2013 enemies become more dangerous, but also more vulnerable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770960/extras/2327e329815c83f653f11e8a86344ac7.poster.avif?t=1754407198\" width=800 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770960/extras/2327e329815c83f653f11e8a86344ac7.webm?t=1754407198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770960/extras/2327e329815c83f653f11e8a86344ac7.mp4?t=1754407198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOUR ESSENTIAL MOVES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Lunge:</strong> Your game-changing move. Quickly dash to an exposed weak point or grab a grapple point for a deadly strike or quick dodge. Fail, and you're open to attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parry &amp; Stagger:</strong> Use your timing to block enemy attacks and fill their stagger meter. When it's full, they'll be stunned, and their weak points will glow \u2013 your chance to deliver a powerful attack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heavy Smashes:</strong> Break through armor, knock down enemies, and destroy the environment to create obstacles or new routes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smart Positioning:</strong>\u00a0Find the right angles for devastating attacks, take advantage of high ground, and use enemy strength against them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STAY AGGRESSIVE, STAY ALIVE:</strong><br>Destroy weak points to recover health and stay in the fight for longer. Experience intense, strategic combat, mixed with exploration and physics-based puzzles, all while using your core combat moves.</p>",
    "short_description": "An adventure-packed slasher where you play as the heir to a legendary blade, crushing armies of faded stars and battling the very creators of the universe.",
